Towe andika: (['a:b:'] - [':']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: (['-'] - ['--']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: ([''] - ['--']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: (['--'] - ['']), mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: ([''] - ['']), mstari-mpya.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Towe andika: x, mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: y, mstari-mpya.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x badilisha: [''] kwa: ['xx'].
Towe andika: ((x sawa: y) ama: ['OK'] au: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), mstari-mpya.